      84.48,
      387.19,
      286.68,
      408.8
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: 6/3/7/15/07/03. Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: LD/05/2007/MV/118C.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      410.24,
      286.68,
      523.76
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:- Public purpose means: Land Acquisition for Moragahakanda and Kaluganga Development Project. .",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      525.19,
      286.71,
      627.19
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: The allotments of land shown in Topopp 17 Supplement No. 23, Sheet No. 70 approved by Surveyor General on 22.05.2013, Situated at Medapihilla Village in Medapihilla Grama Niladhari Division Gangala Pallesiya of Naula Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Matale District, Central Province, and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      628.64,
      286.63,
      661.76
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 3126 Name of the land: Kendagolla; Description: Light Forest; Claimant: State; Extent: 0.0835 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      336.56,
      539.83,
      369.68
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 3167 Name of the land: Kendagolla; Description: Light Forest; Claimant: State; Extent: 0.03551 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      371.12,
      539.82,
      415.52
    ],
    "text": "3. Lot No. 3168 Name of the land: Kendagolla; Description: Garden; Claimant: State; Extent: 1.1989 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      427.54,
      539.88,
      557.11
    ],
    "text": "All Person interested in the aforesaid Land on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Naula Divisional Secretariat on the 25th day of August 2016 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in wiring (in duplicate) on or before the 18th day of August, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
